# publication yet.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Resilient UAS Lab in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
title: Resilient UAS Lab
abstract: >-
  Open-source resilience engineering and chaos testing platform for autonomous systems.
  Declarative scenarios inject the effects of degradation (GNSS loss, datalink loss,
  sensor failure, compute restarts, resource pressure, abstract electromagnetic
  transient consequence profiles) into a simulated or mock unmanned aircraft system,
  observe the response, and produce reproducible resilience metrics, scores and reports.
authors:
